      "description": "Read an IG repository's GitHub releases and write `fhir-artifact-index/releases.json` (`ig-releases/v1`): each asset's name, size, SHA-256 digest and download URL, never its bytes. The IG site's generated `releases` page lists them (bean `b8ip`).",
